        NDA_Broker__c, NDA_Status__c, NDA_Date_Sent__c, NDA_Date_Signed__c, NDA_Expiry_Date__c

    ⚠ NAME COLLISIONS ACROSS OBJECTS - READ THE OBJECT PREFIX, NOT THE FIELD NAME. Six of these
    names also exist on OTHER objects and those are NOT touched:
        LOI__c.LOI_Status__c, LOI__c.LOI_Signed_Date__c   (the real fields, on the real LOI)
        NDA__c.NDA_Expiry_Date__c                          (read by NdaExpiryAlertBatch)
        Disposition_Offer__c.NDA_Status__c                 (read by dispositionLogOfferModal)
        Opportunity.Primary_LOI__c, Opportunity.Primary_NDA__c
    Every member below is object-qualified. Do not "simplify" them.

    ⚠ THESE Disposition__c FIELDS ARE **NOT** IN THIS LIST AND MUST NOT BE ADDED TO IT:
