                              DispositionNdaStampQueueable, which eleven other class headers cite as the
                              canonical ENTITY_IS_LOCKED -> defer-to-Queueable example. Nothing
                              READS it as of 2026-08-25 - that is stated openly in its own file -
                              but removing it is a separate change needing its own sign-off.
        NDA_Count__c          Number fields, not formulas. Maintained by the NDA_Signed_Rollup
        Signed_NDA_Count__c   flow and read by the All_NDAs_Signed_Before_Progression release
                              gate. Deleting either silently disables that gate.
        PSA_Executed__c       a plain checkbox on the disposition itself.

